Suppose your company has:

1000 employees

Instead of creating users separately on every computer, the administrator can create users in Active Directory.

For eg:

Active Directory
      |
      +-- Users
           |
           +-- bilal
           +-- john
           +-- david
           +-- sara

You can manage things such as:

Create user
Disable user
Delete user
Reset password
Unlock account
Add user to groups
Set account restrictions

For example:

bilal
  |
  +-- Member of → IT-Support
  |
  +-- Member of → Server-Admins
